# P7-70 formal binaries

Two independent cold-cache zjs ReleaseFast build instances and two independent
pinned-qjs binary identities. Build A and build B are NOT byte-identical, so
they are two build instances and compiler state is NOT claimed to be pairable;
there is no free noise ruler this round.

