## binary build commit vs measurement-time HEAD
Both zjs binaries were compiled while the worktree HEAD was `042e4962`. The
formal artifacts record `meta.zjs.commit = 1fb79bc3` because the runner infers
the commit from the binary's directory at *measurement* time, and the five
tooling commits landed between the build and the run. Nothing under src/ moved:

```
$ git diff 042e4962 1fb79bc3 -- src/ | wc -l
0
```
